            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1+2SA.9.2+2SA.9.3+2SA.9.4+2SA.9.5+2SA.9.6+2SA.9.7+2SA.9.8+2SA.9.9+2SA.9.10+2SA.9.11+2SA.9.12+2SA.9.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Sam 9:1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.1+2SA.16.2+2SA.16.3+2SA.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kungwïn Mepiposyet nyo pö ka Saulö kïtarok pöytoghin amelö kiwun kelyechi anta mut tamughyenyi anta mwat sïrokachi, kïngata otini kingeta pöytoghintö Yerusalem ntökïmïla nyo karam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyini kituna Mepiposyet Yerusalem kungwïn kïtarok pöytoghin, kïtep pöytoghintö nyinte lö, “Kilïkwï ne tömewenyi nko ani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö, “Inkïtönyi we pöytoghin lö, ochan mwolöy, kyomwochan mötworintenyan lö, ‘Rata sïkïryenyan atowan nko nyi,’ wölo kïlïsanïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwökanïn nyinte ompö wölo imitenyi. Wölo körökegh echotyontenyan nko malaykayanta Tororöt, kïlenyona igha kïgh nyo isïwïyenyi lö karam ompö nyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kimïtchinecha meghat, ani nko koto paponyan ompö wölo imitenyi, wölo anyï ye ketönaninyi nko pich cho omisyegho mesengu. Ne kitö nyu anka nyo tosominyi pöytoghin?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï pöytoghintö nyinte, “Ne tengangtena ngaleku cho chang? Kamwaghan lö nyi nko Sipa cho ochöghöy kore.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Mepiposyet pöytoghin, “Nya kïcheng Sipa onkït, kikïmïchanïn nyini kemïlenyi kaw nyo karam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keporchï Daudi köromnyö Parsilay",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kingwïn tïkwïl Parsilay nyo pö Kiliad kungwïna Rokelim kïtarok pöytoghin atökungarak kwowï lalwa Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikikïyosit Parsilay, kitïng könyis 80 akitö nyinte pöytoghin omisyö atay kimi Maanaim, ompöwölo kimakos nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï pöytoghintö Parsilay, “Nyonö kepe nko ani Yerusalem atö apaghïn ompö wölini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenchï Parsilay pöytoghin, “Tya könyiswö cho tomöngan nya, nyo tomukan owetöy nko pöytoghin Yerusalem? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otïngetan ye könyis 80, melö tosïwïyan kïgh nyo karam nko nyo gha amelö tonkïtön kïgh nyo kyomöy anta cho kïgheghöy amolïmanye kutïwa tumï. Pö ne nyu alïkwan nïkisïn ompö nyi nya pöytoghin? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö tökïmïchinanïn konunötö nyo tenö nyona, awetan pat nko nyi kite ntetïlanyi Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanya amïlan kaw toröpösyan wöloni aketïpchanïn kamasu pïrïmpeto yiyichan. Wölo anyï werïnyan Kimam, nya kïwö nyinte nko nyi, ighchï nyinte kïgh nyo isïwïyenyi lö karam ompö nyi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlö pöytoghintö, “Wetöy Kimam nko ani aghchinan nyinte kïgh nyo karam ompö nyi awunyi kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo imökenyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwoghyö pich löwïr Yordan akwoghyö pöytoghintö tïkwïl, kukonköy pöytoghintö Parsilay akusoyön atolapay kïwö Parsilay katanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kemöl kegh pipö Yuda nko Israel akwompö pöytoghin",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kikwowï pöytoghintö lalwa akimi pipö Yuda löwïr kumïtöy nyinte nko kareranpa pipö Israel, kïwö kutang Kilkal, akïwö Kimam tïkwïl nko nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïpka pipö Israel löwïr wölo mi pöytoghin akïlenchï, “Ompö ne tökwigh kegh werköcha pipö Yuda lö kïtïng man kemïtunyi owunö lalwa Yordan nko katangu nko piköku?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïwöghökyï pipö Yuda pipö Israel lö, “Kakighacha lenyoni ompöwölo pö pöytoghintö arencha. Ompö ne nyu tökwighakwa nyoni onyölisyenö? Akwanyï melö kökonecha pöytoghintö omisyö anta ropöw.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïyokyï pipö Israel pipö Yuda lö, “Kïchicha ortïn taman, kïlenyona kïtïngetecha man ompö Daudi kïtïlakwa, kwompö ne tosösechakwa? Akwanyï ompö acha cho kikïpo tagh kengalanena mïlaghpa pöytoghin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
